#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:245
#: 789a1e8451134823aa557bcedaeba932
msgid ""
"Once the Windows VM boots, a CDROM should appear in the ‘My Computer’ menu "
"(typically as ``D:`` or ``E:``) with the setup program with the setup "
"program ``qubes-tools-x64.msi`` for Windows 7 or ``qubes-tools-4.2.2.exe`` "
"for Windows 10 and 11 in its main directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows-tools.rst:247
#: 7184ecd456fd4216b1eae7074547a46e
